# CODEOWNERS — gcp-postgres-terraform

This module creates GCP CloudSQL PostgreSQL instances and exposes their
credentials via Secret Manager. Cross-project consumers (services in other
GCP projects that read these secrets) must be listed here so the
`gcp-postgres-terraform` maintainer is automatically requested as a reviewer
when a consumer PR changes its access pattern, and so the maintainer is
notified when IAM grants for that consumer change.

## Pattern

When a new repo consumes `module "postgres"` from this repo, add a CODEOWNERS
line for that repo. The owner should be the repo's primary maintainer (often
the org operator; verify per repo).

## Cross-project consumers

- `DarojaAI/research-orchestrator` — reads Postgres secrets for the
  `rag_research_tool` DB after PR #42 (`chore/db-consolidate-on-rag-research`,
  merged 2026-08-11). IAM binding lives in PR #87 against this repo.
